[{"title":"蒲席歌","author":"艾性夫","text":"君不见象床金缕黄龙须，翠帏茸毯红氍毹。\n凝香燕寝环琼姝，美物作恶常须臾。\n能令王孙泣路隅，富贵不到山中臞。\n霜空雁落寒陵肤，西溪女郎织春蒲。\n作席眼眼涵清腴，发僧方丈供横铺。\n苍烟翠雾不可摹，摩挲温厚便鹤躯。\n高眠齁齁忘朝晡，远梦飒飒生江湖。\n楮衾竹榻蒲为徒，观美不足安有馀。\n更生九节寿老夫，百年与尔同卷舒，清风傲兀超几蘧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27206,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"解棋","author":"艾性夫","text":"两雄相持机不发，一著输先智相轧。\n退守皆虞虎穴空，通和不肯鸿沟割。\n危枰已属堕甑里，巧势争看强弩末。\n疲思嘿嘿鬼神寂，密运茫茫天地阔。\n悍鸡趁斗不暇咮，骏马争驰各忘秣。\n矰禽睥睨欲高举，罝兔迷离思远脱。\n死中求生背水阵，灰冷复焚馀烛跋。\n白登倏报沛公走，阏与俄闻赵师活。\n傍观骇服算入妙，对局虚骄气方夺。\n人生胜负何可期，生达难欺死诸葛。\n推枰一笑拍阑干，满袖松风凉泼泼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27207,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬春湖史履庸惠四皓图","author":"艾性夫","text":"有客有客吾春湖，踏霜打门呼老夫。\n寒温粗了不暇坐，两手奉我商山图。\n皓首庞眉发如漆，千古高人谁画出。\n疏行大字各题诗，颇类涪翁老年笔。\n绮里季，夏黄公，春风拍浮酒两钟。\n仰天但觉宇宙窄，麾麈一扫尘凡空。\n东园角里更萧散，石鼎茶瓢风日晚。\n琵琶不作儿女悲，横琴静送飞鸿远。\n周家遗民方避秦，留侯眼高识天人。\n翩翩小出奠危社，落落高举连青云。\n感君持赠慰枯槁，玉雪辉辉见诸老。\n何当乘鹤参翱翔，风露清凉咽瑶草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27208,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题云锦刘从甫水竹云山亭","author":"艾性夫","text":"玻璃冷浸清湘玉，白衣暖护秋屏绿。\n淮南公子有胜情，收拾四美归吾亭。\n问君亭中更何有，解事家人频送酒。\n客来醉赏不得归，拍阑朗诵亭中诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27209,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题东坡蔗滓窠石","author":"艾性夫","text":"空洞如虚拳，拥肿类奇瘿。\n槎牙老树身，相依以为命。\n智士能用屈，榴皮胜毛颖。\n先生倒啖馀，此正入佳境。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27210,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题叶氏分绿亭","author":"艾性夫","text":"山亭种花厌脂粉，纯种芭蕉三百本。\n一心生意展不尽，四面蟠根培自稳。\n捲舒风日闪流翠，滉滉清阴浸窗户。\n烦君净拭湘竹床，著我横眠听秋雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27211,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题危见心所藏陈常庵水月障及松鹤芦雁各一首 其二","author":"艾性夫","text":"墨池幻出虬龙蟠，徂徕山头烟雨寒。\n胎禽独立衣缟缟，骨瘦西风拾瑶草。\n灵根琥珀三千年，紫皇敕赐青城仙。\n乘轩窃禄正自恶，何似归来一丘壑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27212,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题危见心所藏陈常庵水月障及松鹤芦雁各一首 其一","author":"艾性夫","text":"陈郎笔势并州剪，十幅生绡秋绿远。\n老蟾欲作骑鲸游，推堕玉盘波底转。\n谪仙濡袍窥采石，东坡醉客歌赤壁。\n两翁已矣爱者谁，我欲扁舟擪长笛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27213,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题危见心所藏陈常庵水月障及松鹤芦雁各一首 其三","author":"艾性夫","text":"风吹黄沙石碛冷，霜苇无声弄寒影。\n兵尘隔断衡阳云，溪藤捲送潇湘景。\n芦花雪老菰米秋，芙蓉露下天悠悠。\n阿奴呼起字不断，写出万斛江南愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27214,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题陈抟题壁图","author":"艾性夫","text":"长松梢梢老烟雾，瀑泉飞落千丈布。\n树精摇手不敢呵，雅是仙人熟眠处。\n睡蛇未死惊起来，风吹野服冠崔嵬。\n双髽窣窣磨老瓦，墨汁湑湑翻莓苔。\n一翁拥彗供扫壁，一翁耸膊观落笔。\n欲写未写方昂头，野趣含秋正萧瑟。\n先生壮志神龙骧，欲跨八表提天纲。\n市衢呼酒沃侠客，岂肯老死苍山傍。\n忽来驴上听鸣镝，中原王气开皇极。\n心事西峰一首诗，真人自在陈桥驿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27215,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题陈所翁为叶半隐作全龙邀同赋","author":"艾性夫","text":"鸱夷饮江共晓汲，麈尾拂屏翻墨汁。\n密云黯黯扶天来，黑风冥冥吹海立。\n涛奔浪骇恣神怪，惊起苍龙九渊蛰。\n须髯怒插霜戟寒，鳞甲光摇春雨湿。\n身蟠远势欲万里，吻渴沧溟归一吸。\n僧繇汗背叶公走，祇合庸奴事供给。\n所翁湖海陈元龙，小傍皇华在原隰。\n酒酣作画特馀事，大手能旋倚天笠。\n只恐通神风雨急，抉破天门夜飞入，明日山翁倚屏泣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27216,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题明皇醉归图","author":"艾性夫","text":"金车山重牛难挽，五花嘶出长春苑。\n太官供顿宴骊山，三郎沉醉归来晚。\n酩酊马上扶者谁，秀眉照眼两国姨。\n红香把臂手亦软，三马相倚不敢驰。\n黄门拥道尽端美，锦衫绣帽春风起。\n解酲尚恐需馀尊，捧把玉卮行复止。\n最后一马寿王妃，鸾扇夹侍双琼姬。\n酣酣嘿嘿意自远，恨不醑我渔阳儿。\n图陈无逸今安有，却作醉徒供画手。\n昭陵百战大山河，凉州几瓮葡萄酒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27217,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵大年奉议小景","author":"艾性夫","text":"江头古树片叶无，槎牙老龙爪角枯。\n风含雪意天欲晚，冻栖不动鸲鹆满。\n翩翩四翼来何迟，睥睨欲泊无空枝。\n写生贵活意独到，明朝嘈杂听渠噪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27218,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题曾逵臣草虫","author":"艾性夫","text":"蝘蜓走昂头，螳螂怒张臂。\n走欲捕生怒欲制，笔活能融两虫意。\n无人饭汝金砂红，糜肌粉肉牢守宫，草间敢尔誇豪雄。\n捕蝉幸脱黄雀舌，轻斗悬知腰股折，力微谨勿当车辙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27219,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠古崖复上人游","author":"艾性夫","text":"高僧如云不受缚，乌藤五尺陪行脚。\n几年陈迹旋磨牛，一日横空出笼鹤。\n江山悠远天宇阔，眼力穷时吟吻渴。\n含新咽秀入清脾，蔬笋敢污甘露钵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27220,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠后山僧谦自牧游","author":"艾性夫","text":"为僧不游醯瓮鸡，游不名山沮泽龟。\n见山无诗僧亦俗，诗不高古犹无诗。\n吾谦年少钟老气，发根甫断拨云去。\n归来笠雪两肩寒，已觉囊中有佳句。\n一枝瘦杖万里心，策策尚欲穷幽寻。\n湖光山绿上下竺，谷花溪月东西林。\n我亦爱山行不得，把酒高歌壮行色。\n为语春风九里松，题诗野客今头白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27221,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠族子治鬼疾","author":"艾性夫","text":"瞠狞电目头蒙倛，两手握断青桃枝。\n丹符落火六丁走，白昼破柱神雷飞。\n何物尸虫作妖魅，敢上天庭聒天耳。\n坐俘心腹三彭仇，生馘膏肓双孺子。\n君不见大巫擒鬼先擒王，质蹻猥琐不足当。\n请君为我祓不祥，疾驱威霆行鬼方，馀力熙河锄鬼章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27222,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠福希范游","author":"艾性夫","text":"伽梨点破长萝绿，瓣香问信黄梅熟。\n筇云笠雪霜色寒，法宇归来诗满腹。\n春风破晓来打门，行矣庐山与天竺。\n天空云远意未尽，却上天台恣游目。\n吾闻天台石桥滑如竹，千僧万僧畏涉足。\n请师了此一大事，一洗世间凡眼肉。\n浮杯试罢海风高，归就梅花结吟屋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27223,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹭答鸭","author":"艾性夫","text":"□勿生天地，营己合有私。\n鱼虾性所嗜，丁独令尔肥。\n□□赋我形，延颈正有需。\n吾颈高可跂，吾休颈可飞。\n吾喙长可啄，吾目光可窥。\n是皆尔所短，胡乃责我为。\n我亦号雪客，污我我有辞。\n君不见秦亡其鹿共逐时，高材疾足先得之。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27224,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋村","author":"艾性夫","text":"稻黄雁入蔗境，水落鹭过屠门。\n一片寒烟晚景，数声牧笛秋村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27225,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"落梅","author":"艾性夫","text":"翠羽嘈嘈唤梦回，罗浮峰下小徘徊。\n霜风昨夜捲晴雪，山路今朝无碧苔。\n尚有瘦香供玉笛，不将馀片点妆台。\n少须鼎实明人眼，却带江南烟雨来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27226,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别离词 其二","author":"艾性夫","text":"渡江桃叶郎莫歌，巴西竹枝愁更多。\n黄尘百丈水花黑，把酒劝郎无渡河。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27227,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣纱曲","author":"艾性夫","text":"浣纱如妾心，皎然照冰雪。\n秋声入络纬，炯炯织霜月。\n裁衣嫁作梁鸿妇，白发相看如此布。\n不学西施矜媚妩，妆成欲觅君王顾。\n忘却土城山下路，贪向铜龙溪边住。\n明朝吴骑猛如虎，献入娃宫作俘虏。\n含羞短制衣楚楚，忍学翩翩鹤翎舞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27228,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"儿馁嗔郎罢妻寒怨藁砧唐眉山诗也戏为笺之","author":"艾性夫","text":"父天不可嗔，夫君不宜怨。\n要知古圣贤，贵在素贫贱。\n父常煮字不成饭，夫常织文不成绢，衣粗布衣龁藜苋。\n去耕原上田，往种陌上桑。\n穫云秋穗重，缲雪春丝长。\n汝温汝饱官征忙，翁出校书为汝偿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27229,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丫头岩诗载墙壁间无虑数十百首形容盖有尽之者矣辄复寄兴以俟采诗者择焉 其二","author":"艾性夫","text":"女色无丑妍，入宫皆见妒。\n蛾眉等刍蛹，嬉笑藏刀锯。\n未笄化为石，不愿长门去。\n国风直待歌螽斯，委身事主妾不辞。\n君不见赵王如意今日死，明日佳人亦投厕。\n何如山头化石千岁老无子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27230,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丫头岩诗载墙壁间无虑数十百首形容盖有尽之者矣辄复寄兴以俟采诗者择焉 其一","author":"艾性夫","text":"色盛人自怜，色衰人见弃。\n人心不可凭，女色焉足恃。\n未笄化为石，不愿从夫婿。\n厌华喜质如梁鸿，布衣操臼当相从。\n君不见汉家天子刘文叔，郭后容衰亦遭逐。\n何如山头化石不嫁老亦足。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27231,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荷叶","author":"艾性夫","text":"爱莲尽爱花，而我独爱叶。\n水仙剪圆碧，万柄相倚叠。\n风掀翠釜举，露浥鲛珠晔。\n不必满川红，香气自薰浃。\n龟鱼荫凉影，鹭鸥憩别业。\n洁可包龙城贾客之饭，清可制三闾修士之衣。\n大可载太乙真人之卧，高可盖桐江神女之归。\n醉仙捲作碧玉盏，歌妓携来绿云扇。\n有时听雨隔窗眠，湖声十里钱塘晚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27232,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雁塔","author":"艾性夫","text":"君不见春初淮白鱼，秋深黄雀儿。\n川潜山泊谁得知，灾身不幸甘且肥。\n官饕弗渠赦，竟作一网打。\n头颅千百奉苞苴，猩红熊白风斯下。\n吾生亦何好，独坐味颇厚。\n急符星火督虞人，覆巢空类无遗噍。\n宁逢江南射生手，莫遇雁门馋太守。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27233,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"边公式","text":"松萝深处有神天，小刹何妨纳大千。\n挂塔定知宣久住，歌吟何幸得流传。\n袖中出简聊应尔，门上题诗岂偶然。\n顾我未除烦恼习，与师同结未来缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27234,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝命词","author":"边居谊","text":"孤城高倚汉江秋，血战三年死未休。\n铁石肝肠忠义胆，精灵常向岘山留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27235,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"净明寺","author":"边郎中","text":"疏篁葱茜云添润，乱石玲珑藓借斑。\n小有洞从仇穴入，妙峰顶对德云间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27236,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"边惇德","text":"敢向诗坛挑老将。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27237,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题妙庭观 其一","author":"边维岳","text":"飞桥翼翼傍云岑，田宅荒凉一径深。\n想像吹笙凉彻夜，却疑风竹助遗音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27238,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临刑口占","author":"邛州僧","text":"宿业因缘人不知，如今啐啄与同时。\n今生欢喜偿他了，来世分明不欠伊。\n梦幻色身从败坏，闲田虚树已生枝。\n休休休也归家去，石女怀胎产一儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27239,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题金山","author":"龙大渊","text":"梵天台殿枕江流，形胜先推第一洲。\n不战屈人当设险，楼船况有万貔貅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27240,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游九锁","author":"龙大渊","text":"峰峦九锁路萦盘，翠色沾衣作晚寒。\n日暮神仙归洞府，雨馀星斗下天坛。\n人生何用千钟贵，老去须求一室安。\n会得谷神元不死，世间何事可相干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27241,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大涤洞天留题","author":"龙友","text":"每见杭人说洞霄，恨无双翼兴飘飘。\n恍观石势如蟠兽，静听泉声若春韶。\n既想洞天多窈妙，更知仙境绝尘嚣。\n官游到此劳人甚，准拟时来酌一瓢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27242,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三山即事","author":"龙昌期","text":"百货随潮船入市，万家沽酒市垂帘。\n苍烟巷陌青榕老，白露园林紫蔗甜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27243,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"故乡","author":"龙昌期","text":"桤木惭桑低别壤，芋苗护稻远分行。\n上书莫道便他郡，学稼终宜老故乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27244,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"福州","author":"龙昌期","text":"等闲田地多栽竹，是处人家爱读书。\n饮宴直尝千户酒，盘餐唯候两潮鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27245,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏门","author":"龙昌期","text":"枢动本为荣辱主，常因户外细推寻。\n乾坤出入无穷象，夷狄关防有限心。\n掩到善人非远大，开当古道自高深。\n九成载举箫韶奏，穆穆无凶合在今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27246,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十一月初四日五鼓纪梦寄外","author":"龙辅","text":"昨夜有佳梦，驰书报与郎。\n隔门须是近，有臭必然香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27247,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其十二","author":"龙辅","text":"茅屋拥红炉，聊在山中宿。\n枉却几上灯，无书供夜读。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27248,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其七","author":"龙辅","text":"跻攀不辞远，微汗湿红粉。\n万一有桃源，当期郎共隐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27249,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其五","author":"龙辅","text":"寄郎以山字，得无无解处。\n得郎一人来，便可成仙去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27250,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其十三","author":"龙辅","text":"娇儿渐聪慧，出语解人意。\n促奴须早归，恐爷书又至。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27251,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其二","author":"龙辅","text":"湖色开明镜，峦光列翠屏。\n双眉不忍画，羞对远山青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27252,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其九","author":"龙辅","text":"妾在山中来，郎在溪头住。\n郎若泛舟寻，莫误桃源路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27253,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其四","author":"龙辅","text":"若得共此栖，松菊长携手。\n岸上数株松，何须减五柳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27254,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其十","author":"龙辅","text":"闻郎今日来，日斜何不至。\n应知篙橹迟，羡杀云中翅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27255,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其十四","author":"龙辅","text":"寄郎三片玉，至今无报音。\n深山多古迹，不得共郎寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27256,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其十一","author":"龙辅","text":"利名何足事，山中乐未央。\n郎如学耕耨，奴便学蚕桑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27257,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄外 其十五","author":"龙辅","text":"买舟不论价，但愿舟不迟。\n归时与郎面，不致效秋时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27258,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋","author":"龙辅","text":"寂寂中秋夜，含情出玉闺。\n河长看雁远，月皎觉云低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27259,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兰梅诗","author":"龙辅","text":"兰梅逐候舒，种此欲何如。\n兰叶堪崇佩，梅花好寄书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27260,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写怀","author":"龙辅","text":"初听莺声又燕声，年华不待使人惊。\n桂花开遍门还掩，风自清时月自明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27261,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至","author":"龙辅","text":"冬至宵虽短，孤眠恨自长。\n枕单寒入梦，窗破月窥床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27262,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬晓","author":"龙辅","text":"积雨带晴雾，闺中事可誇。\n曙窗留镜月，寒髻集钗花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27263,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏示女伴","author":"龙辅","text":"谁道孤眠苦，孤眠却自强。\n请看隔宿髻，常是不劳妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27264,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪梦","author":"龙辅","text":"梦中握手说离愁，梦觉欢娱忽已休。\n安得人生真似梦，华胥蝴蝶共悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27265,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"制履寄外","author":"龙辅","text":"何物寄殷勤，宫鞋绿锦文。\n为郎承素足，指日踏青云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27266,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"恨","author":"龙辅","text":"背人解素袜，裂断寄郎边。\n须知销玉骨，无兴步金莲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27267,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日 其三","author":"龙辅","text":"侵阶草逾碧，明窗日渐迟。\n携针听语鸟，牵断绣床丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27268,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日 其二","author":"龙辅","text":"春服初裁绮，寒衣始卸绒。\n花宿全慵蝶，林摇半暖风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27269,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日写怀","author":"龙辅","text":"暖气逼房楹，开帘多鸟声。\n竹春思笋嫩，地日识泥晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27270,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]